{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《美食新聞報道》帶領觀眾走訪兩間極具特色的食店！大廚葉世昌師傅與主持黃婧靈（波波）率先品嚐特色雞煲與滋味火鍋；隨後，主持施焯日（Arthur）與葉靖儀（Michelle）則帶大家造訪巨星謝霆鋒從小吃到大的經典茶餐廳，尋找地道美味。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">去到屯門的在再來一煲，品嚐火鍋前，先以一道生醃三文魚剌身打開胃口。這道菜式嚴選魚味濃郁的挪威三文魚，巧妙融入潮式生醃手法；入口帶有青檸的酸甜，濃郁的香草完美滲透魚肉之中，清新又爽胃。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">緊接登場的是招牌惡魔雞煲。雞件經過高溫油炸卻不乾柴，保留了微脆外皮與多汁嫩滑的肉質。濃稠醬汁緊緊包裹雞肉，辣中帶甜，極易入口。雞煲內更加入了富含膠質的江團魚鰾，口感軟糯滋補；配合本地農場直送的新鮮雞腎，火候掌握得宜，咬下時能感受到層次分明的爽脆纖維。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">加入湯底後便是火鍋環節，重點推介牛魔王拼盤：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\">除了火鍋，特色小炒百花炸蝦滑亦不容錯過。將嫩滑蝦膠鑲入豆卜後猛火酥炸，外層如薯片般香脆；蝦膠內特別混入蔥和芫荽，完美中和了炸物的油膩感。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">再來一煲</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">地址：屯門青棉徑6號好發大廈地下17-20號舖</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"cd47446a-85e8-4eac-9380-0b1153b87ff9.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/20260Fb0GdrrHe1785207935.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"cd47446a-85e8-4eac-9380-0b1153b87ff9.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"9f8edc2d-6caa-455b-bf88-ca4720cce426.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/20268tOWJjO40D1785207935.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"9f8edc2d-6caa-455b-bf88-ca4720cce426.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"de28d25f-8cbe-494d-b39f-0176cd98bade.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026xw11dhl8Lw1785207934.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"de28d25f-8cbe-494d-b39f-0176cd98bade.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"f58e1cb9-56c8-476a-9aea-6374dc640bf4.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026BrHiK3sGVG1785207934.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"f58e1cb9-56c8-476a-9aea-6374dc640bf4.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">節目的第二節，主持帶大家來到一間充滿傳統風味的茶餐廳，連<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">巨星謝霆鋒都從小吃到大！</span>多款經典美食：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">正中大排檔</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">地址：筲箕灣東大街57號地舖</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"82393083-834b-4337-89d6-df941b6e2b15.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026gn8ICLdAcN1785207934.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"82393083-834b-4337-89d6-df941b6e2b15.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"e2cb32f2-e4ac-4831-82be-022b33ba4096.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/202664zKdub3M51785207934.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"e2cb32f2-e4ac-4831-82be-022b33ba4096.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"1f9d5d48-30a3-4918-97c6-dfb3f825975c.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026kkc9mg6M171785207934.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"1f9d5d48-30a3-4918-97c6-dfb3f825975c.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"2546f209-03c1-4ae5-9cd4-db5f81a0b9f2.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026tmyJaezBgH1785207934.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"2546f209-03c1-4ae5-9cd4-db5f81a0b9f2.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-01T13:39:49.859155+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":525,"images":8,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}